{"ticker":{"symbol":"FCEL","name":"FuelCell Energy, Inc.","market":"US","exchange":""},"currency":"USD","price":10.57,"change_pct":-0.05709188224799289,"market_cap":845115776.0,"pe":-10.352798,"pb":0.8666776,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":5.71,"week52_high":37.88,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Electrical Equipment & Parts","country":"United States","city":"Danbury","employees":424,"website":"https://www.fuelcellenergy.com","business_summary":"FuelCell Energy, Inc., a clean energy technology company, engages in the design, development, production, construction, operation, and servicing of high temperature fuel cells for clean electric power generation. It is involved in the provision of carbonate fuel cell technology; and commercialization of solid oxide electrolysis technology for distributed hydrogen. In addition, the company sells electricity, heat, steam, capacity, and renewable energy credits. It serves utilities and independent power producers, data centers, wastewater treatment, commercial and hospitality, and microgrids, as well as others. The company primarily operates in the United States, South Korea, Europe, and Canada. FuelCell Energy, Inc. was founded in 1969 and is headquartered in Danbury, Connecticut.","business_summary_ko":"청정 에너지 기술 기업인 FuelCell Energy, Inc.는 청정 전력 생산을 위한 고온 연료 전지의 설계, 개발, 생산, 건설, 운영 및 서비스를 제공합니다. 탄산염 연료전지 기술 제공에 참여하고 있습니다. 분산수소 고체산화물 전기분해 기술 상용화 또한 회사는 전기, 열, 증기, 용량 및 재생 에너지 크레딧을 판매합니다. 유틸리티 및 독립 전력 생산업체, 데이터 센터, 폐수 처리, 상업 및 숙박업, 마이크로그리드 등의 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 주로 미국, 한국, 유럽 및 캐나다에서 운영됩니다. FuelCell Energy, Inc.는 1969년에 설립되었으며 코네티컷 주 댄버리에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":149192260.0,"rev_lo":139700000.0,"rev_hi":169120000.0,"rev_g":-0.056700002,"n":11,"eps":-2.09892,"eps_lo":-2.93,"eps_hi":-1.8016,"eps_g":0.71629995},{"period":"2027","rev":242238760.0,"rev_lo":223600000.0,"rev_hi":287800000.0,"rev_g":0.62369996,"n":9,"eps":-1.02098,"eps_lo":-1.48,"eps_hi":-0.83,"eps_g":0.5136}],"ltg":null,"calenda